Fabrication</h2><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-329e1bf6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="329e1bf6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>Guests form an impression the moment they walk into your lobby. At Midwest Tropical, we help you shape that moment with custom-designed water features. These can be water walls for hotels, elegant reflection pools for hotels, or something else. Our aim is to create a space that instills a calm yet luxurious feeling that stays with your guests long after their checkout.</p><p>We work with some of the biggest hotel brands in the country. If you have been to the Embassy Suites by Hilton, you may have seen our work but didn’t know it was designed and fabricated by us. Our team designs and installs unique water features that go perfectly with your hotel’s personality, enhance guest experience, and work within your layout. Whether you’re building new or upgrading an existing space, we make it easy to add a standout water feature that works for you. Want to learn more? Give us a call!</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-17202ba" data-id="17202ba" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-54e2880 elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form" data-id="54e2880" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}" data-widget_type="form.default"><form class="elementor-form" method="post" name="New Form" aria-label="New Form"><input type="hidden" name="post_id" value="130020"/><input typ