 <textarea class="elementor-field-textual elementor-field  elementor-size-sm" name="form_fields[message]" id="form-field-message" rows="4" placeholder="Dimension, Design Intent, Comments / Notes"></textarea> </div><div class="elementor-field-type-upload elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-field_8f21363 elementor-col-100"><input type="file" name="form_fields[field_8f21363]" id="form-field-field_8f21363" class="elementor-field elementor-size-sm elementor-upload-field"></div><div class="elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-type-submit elementor-col-100 e-form__buttons"><button class="elementor-button elementor-size-sm" type="submit"><span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"><span class="elementor-button-text">Send</span></span></button></div></div></form></div></div></div></div></section><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-06ddaba e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="06ddaba" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0c254ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0c254ff" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2><strong>Why Hotels Need Water Features</strong></h2><p>A water feature instantly makes a space feel more tuned. In hospitality, that matters. Lobbies, lounges, spas, and even outdoor areas all benefit from the movement and sound of water. It makes your guests feel at ease, and it adds value to your design.</p><ul><li><strong>Aesthetic Appeal</strong></li></ul><p>Water brings a natural beauty that furniture and decor can’t match. A flowing wall or still pool becomes the centerpiece of the space.</p><ul><li><strong>Better Guest Experience</strong></li></ul><p>Water sounds help people feel relaxed. They create a soothing background that makes the lobby or waiting area more pleasant.</p><ul><li><strong>Smart Design Fit</strong></li></ul><p>Our features can serve more than one purpose. Some water walls work as room dividers, while reflection pools add calm to busy areas without taking up much space.</p><p> </p></div><img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-default-img " data-interaction-id="2c503e9" data-e-type="widget" data-id="2c503e9" id="98768" src="/wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-jpg.avif" width="1600" height="1065" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-768x511.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-jpg-1440x959.avif 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-jpg.avif 1600w" alt="water walls in hotel lobby godfrey hotel chicago scored black acrylic waterfalls jpg" title="Hotels 1" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" data-mtfi="1"></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-203abd2 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="203abd2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-100x100.jpg.webp 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-150x113.jpg.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-300x225.jpg.webp 300w, /wp-content/up