ored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-150x113.jpg.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-300x225.jpg.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-380x285.jpg.webp 380w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-480x360.jpg.webp 480w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-640x480.jpg.webp 640w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-768x576.jpg.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-800x600.jpg.webp 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-1024x768.jpg.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-1280x960.jpg.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-1440x1440.jpg.webp 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-1600x1200.jpg.webp 1600w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled-1920x1440.jpg.webp 1920w, /wp-content/uploads/Black-Scored-Acrylic-Water-Wall-at-Maryland-Live-Casino-Hotel-in-Baltimore-Maryland-2-1-scaled.jpg.webp 2560w" alt="Black Scored Acrylic Water Wall at Maryland Live Casino Hotel in Baltimore Maryland 2 1 scaled" title="Hotels 2" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" data-mtfi="1"></picture><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-84a2ceb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="84a2ceb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2><strong>Custom Fabrication of Water Walls for Hotels by Midwest Tropical</strong></h2><p>We create fully custom water walls for hotels, tailored to your space, brand, and customer experience. Each feature is developed to order using top-quality materials like stainless steel, copper, glass, and scored acrylic. You can also choose lighting options to add color, movement, or softness to the look.</p><p>Our water walls fit perfectly into modern, classic, or mixed-style hotels. If you want a statement piece in the lobby or a soft, ambient feature near the elevators or bar area, we breath your idea to life.</p><ul><li><strong>Signature Hotel Projects</strong></li></ul><p>Our long-standing work with Embassy Suites by Hilton shows our experience in this space. These projects require both creativity and consistency, and we deliver on both.</p><ul><li><strong>Built for Time</strong></li></ul><p>Each water wall uses components made for commercial use. We use strong pumps, quiet motors, and smart filtration systems. Everything is easy to maintain and engineered for long-term performance.</p><p> </p></div></div></div><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-42e02cb2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="42e02cb2" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-353a25d2" data-id="353a25d2" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d56eb5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d56eb5b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2><strong>Reflection Pools That Calm and Impress</strong></h2><p>Reflection pools for hotels are another way to add beauty and relaxation to your space. These low-maintenance, shallow pools fit nicely into open areas like garden walkways, spa entrances, or atriums. They add depth to your design and a sense of peace to your environment.</p><p>No matter if you are looking for reflection pools for indoor or outdoor space, we customize the pool size, shape, and materials to fit what you need. We can include LED lighting, stone bases, or floating decor for added visual interest.</p><ul><li><strong>Perfect for Multiple Settings</strong></li></ul><p>Reflection pools work in all types of hotel spaces. They are perfect for both quiet corners of the lobby and outdoor seating areas.</p><ul><li><strong>Reliable and Safe</strong></li></ul><p>We build each pool to withstand foot traffic, cleaning, and seasonal changes. They’re designed for durability and built with safety in mind.</p><p><strong>Trusted by Leading Hotel Brands</strong></p><p>Hotels across the country choose Midwest Tropical for water features that work. We understand what hotel developers, architects, and managers need. Everything from design and branding to maintenance and ease of use, we make sure you are satisfied with our execution.</p><p>We stay involved through the entire process and help make every decision easy. Our team listens, offers suggestions, and makes sure your project meets both design goals and practical needs.</p><p> </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9c8d326 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="9c8d326" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-993fac4" data-id="993fac4" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-85af34a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="85af34a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h3><strong>Start Your Hotel Water Feature Project with Midwest Tropical</strong></h3><p>If you&#8217;re thinking about adding water walls for hotels or a custom reflection pool for hotels, let’s make it happen. At Midwest Tropical, we have decades of experience building water features that fit seamlessly into hotel design plans. Our team understands how to balance beauty with practicality and guest comfort with durability. When you partner with Midwest Tropical, you get something that reflects your brand, pleases your guests, and works for your space.</p><p><strong>Get in Touch for a Quote or Consultation</strong></p><p>If you are ready to start planning your hotel’s next water feature, contact Midwest Tropical today. We’ll work with you to explore your options, recommend the best designs, and walk you through every step of the process. Fill out the contact form or call us to book a free consultation.</p><p> </p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3f1efb2" data-id="3f1efb2" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d00653b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="d00653b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><a href="/gallery/"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-50x50.webp 50w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner